        "message_id": "<20261019014211.4f2a9c@glassworks-nusantara.co.id>"
      },
      "text": "Dear Export Sales Team,\n\nThank you for the catalogue. We are PT Glassworks Nusantara, a glass container\nmanufacturer based in Semarang with one float furnace and two container lines.\n\nPlease quote the following:\n\nProduct     : Soda ash dense, granular\nQuality     : Na2CO3 99.2% min; Fe 0.003% max; particle size +80 mesh 75% min\nQuantity    : 300 MT for the first shipment, approximately 3,000 MT per year\nDelivery    : CFR Semarang, Indonesia\nPacking     : Please advise your standard export packing for this product.\nDocuments   : COA, SDS and TDS with the offer.\n\nFor the sample we will arrange collection with our own forwarder.\n\nPayment: L/C.\n\nKindly note the price should be competitive as we are comparing with our\ncurrent supplier.\n\nWe look forward to your offer.\n\nBest regards,\n\nBudi Santoso\nProcurement Department\nPT Glassworks Nusantara\nKawasan Industri Terboyo Blok C-12\nSemarang 50111, Central Java, Indonesia\nTel: +62 24 766 1234 | HP: 0812 2599 8888\nbudi.santoso@glassworks-nusantara.co.id",
